    "body": "﻿> *This was generated by AI during triage.*\n\nStatus correction after PR #660 ref cleanup on 2026-07-24: PR head is `086d3f4f35079eaab417bfea166335e5ba9c9b9d`. The TargetPos / authoritative-coordinate work is included, but the broader Graph result-contract goal still has one remaining gap: blackboard write ops currently expose no explicit failure when the target state is missing or dead. The remaining blocker is tracked in reopened #669.\r\n",
